reason: "Clause-scoped independent checking and concrete-oracle populations support conditional typed source-region transport, including finite deterministic occurrence paths, complete successor slots, actual predecessor phis, whole-state boundary unions and checked progress. Normal-return induction and checked call summaries additionally support bounded projected-map invariants across supported loops, repeated calls and summary allocations; those postconditions do not establish termination, intermediate effects or actual-use applicability. Complete invariant evidence across the requirement remains outstanding: bounded populations do not establish every admitted source owner, initial state, control edge, alias or summary allocation, captured environment, correlated aggregate, call/effect boundary and certificate dependency together. Unsupported recurrence and unclosed branch, alias or call invariants remain explicit refusals. Complete selected source/native actual-call correspondence supports scoped model-dependent consequences while retaining the source model antecedent and broader applicability obligations. Language zero initialization supplies no native bytes. Imported initialization, intervening frame, concurrency, selected native and harness premises retain their own evidence obligations. This is an uncovered evidence obligation, not a demonstrated implementation contradiction."
